{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1230,
  "batch_count": 1682,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "f1c6893d60a8989361cfd9c371f56bc8ec25f81d",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eaf33964546374170d7e615b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天好像可以拿到这个。",
      "source_fingerprint": "79aa3eb8be8928df97d087de08297f0f115cbf90eda07cae7c26ff7bd1b55b9e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19cf91c411624a41b4eb5b27",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可恶，提不起力气……\r\n看来最近是真的冲过头了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad677b5f4acbe45bc15824af7ff72d9e20adb377a3aa2cff1e685cac2d451abe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90388485918de78686354ee3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近我常常走神啊～\r\n有种疲劳一直无法消除的感觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "819973813d6e846e155bef11fa9f64b97c1328724e277e467f832f78d99a63cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4574b13596afb51b7a3168c1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦哦哦哦！绝・好・调！！\r\n感觉我现在什么事都办得到！",
      "source_fingerprint": "abbbdfb338df963c258fc2f0fcb9de9ee69849e91e8f91b1dee74591cf84d36a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5186d174580d5f68aa12b516",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "轰隆隆轰隆隆ー！\r\n我心脏这颗引擎\r\n已经发热到绝佳状态咯～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a116b86882efc23dda6bf58d5e8cb2859f8e1ccbf4d36b228a4b8b11688e225",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf47f9d8d7bc1a19918a9921",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "快开始吧！\r\n我已经等不及要活动身体了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6348502261b2ea40865273da4b0b6f30b5ecd3ec5e1581600db2977a8366697",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19800811b31a14e8993754b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "气势十足！\r\n无论是什么内容都无所谓。\r\n我都会完成给你看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ab1f693e07afd367f878cd97d102d1f0067aca1ce46ea52964b3e85fbde5acc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e3c87b411cd3f878eb142b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "依照惯例，\r\n全力锻炼吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a734edff3c08b87821cab05bdbd0c68432e559c7190610ad16825636c8875770",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a16327a8d17703d40768d682",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哟！\r\n这次是怎样的训练计划啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "bdc091c6a260cc953834daeea26782bd8915f4ef61d81f926d07623e91b946bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b02742a012e12eb4d191928f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有没有更帅气的训练方式啊。\r\n这样我也能做得更起劲嘛～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "906dabd0665e0285c23e45d6d6d15a89e6f5c6f653968e6552da1066cd6cac50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7784159f29aa112482fac234",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊ー！使不出力气啊～！\r\n但这种时候必须撑住才行，对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d404c97794a9f9ce90e8913d8530b19259207e442f8262a7904e636d6a73275",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cbf355f4e987e606c1d3cb5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唉ー，身体好沉重啊ー。\r\n好想骑车转换一下心情……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3aa1007ef3a1214674b8939dc7a10c5ec0767621cb53668f7f443c60daf29303",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf19b565233a3e61d00c6f40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "提不起劲啊……\r\n可恶，这样真的感觉很逊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "150bbfc2afdc2b9cf81383b19297281575376edd3d832182ab95baa89543c0bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:123bc1a48dc3d3770306f88a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂喂，又要参赛吗？\r\n也差不多该让我休息了吧……\r\n不然关键时刻怎么还有力气啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4feb7910b370cbd30b082535d9dab316f80b07aa0043c0d4cc4e8de7f1eec37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ec6fd7c84fe75c81bdeff13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呃！又～要我参赛！？\r\n……这未免太夸张了吧。\r\n真的，你重新想想吧。好吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "9259b90c870d06546a2645fa9fca496d04c3c3e0e97bae2163faaebcecdb7b3a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d835be29b5ac4acfe59838d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "目前状态非常好！\r\n让大家见识\r\n我载着胜利女神的结果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e934288e02dda2dce8f8f80a98183bc93972cae7903e82d7b129a42429250875",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cd0925cd8771bb033c9b83a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇～～！力量一直在涌现啊！\r\n让我用最快速的攻击直冲终点吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cbbc467169a0e3f8afbfbae8f0d5285869d41b78153632aed656081a3e6a6a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d9cc4affb2be1a2427d3b46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啊～！！\r\n我的血液也在轰隆隆地沸腾～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e42eb38f25838caf33f33a6fc23f727efbabc7dca6e12cc7030f61c72c233dca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8b965e5c14fd30240dc1690",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态也调整得很好！\r\n感觉输不了啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cc12fd31fbbbfe6f0ac4d739a9ca3e543f55061d6ad30148b7dc5d9ae0b6828",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31d543c0e8ca6732fc66cff4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态良好！\r\n看来能跟着风一起狂奔呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c19c97680b5582d3285f9c0785aa25048eb8360658991fbb600092b44cb5b0a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a0c74811afb91c388cdc18a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脚好轻盈啊……嘿嘿！\r\n你好好期待比赛的结果吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "361236ee6aeb9c40eb61137e168bed67dfcb1714fa2a724ad7530e94b1a0b7b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:866db2fe0743086301a936e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "老样子，我会用这双脚跑赢的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4959af0bb38b30e90c8f3de6f5b6e6d8e420e63896a27ae945f0df92ea1824e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4124258910b1c45f5c92f44",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态还不错，\r\n照平时的跑法应该就能轻松取胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "786e5a7d4e1ed35279d50dc1c950bc16474f224c226a7d39917fc66f6fbc5065",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:320e20f53de049c11dce676c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这次也没有什么不同，\r\n就是跑赢大家～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "950d85acfd7265a0a9e0925bca1b0fa721bd34a0bc09255ad16eea2028ecdc2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5b281072e8a1b25ee889fb4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然我……提不起力气！\r\n但这种状态下要是赢了，就特别帅啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2f8d0108095adae15930321468da7901dfd055098ee3491f64e3625e461bf80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e710c4da64afbad01956ff2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽不能说是准备万全……\r\n但不跑到最后是不会知道结果的。\r\n这就是比赛的乐趣！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4928c442da1c0f0c1df8e2f8b019b1447ff615d9bfaf4c01d3edb00d69ec937f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dce3d691cc5e688db0a3477",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算状态不好……我也会赢的。\r\n开始前就觉得自己会输的话，\r\n原本能赢的比赛也要输掉了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd8db24507f662a78354c80ba13e031f444d92424bd5061f4a72945018480388",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81d0de8e56e2846144717233",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可恶！身体好沉重啊……\r\n但我是不会放弃的。\r\n努力挣扎到最后才是我的风格！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d119c152efe2179dc1519cb21b57a23103a36fef105eb304c71b3d024220865d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bde49f882c440c065f797b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "即使有所不安，我也只能\r\n继续向前奔跑……因为我可是\r\n继承了骑士之魂的人啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea49612c9730484e67bc9dc958de2ce0bae98f3c6d94e0c34f937e2edfd0d91c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e89682796bb57c8d6436ab28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我现在的状态的确糟透了。\r\n但承担的风险越高就越刺激，\r\n也会让我感到更加热血……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b82feaa0e0566d0612811d47038a4f569c827e4908d28446742ed3a7d7644a12",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54f8614c4fcea431b624f678",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要上咯ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab8bb0a79ddfb24cfe9e885b7256c9fe4d69c7801d7de255f9787662c4e2267f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0468e9218b3e424c1f998a4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "156457bc54ba27ebeaab1aba3aaf9a68ceea61cd9f05dfb3deffdb2be3ad073e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c909630f402c6bd8d8340f60",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "交给我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "abd39c284289b19c8944436e7ca3b6b2ead589d70912da6f1ecd3665819f7367",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf5121cadf0dbe3c0fae4dbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是学习么～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "19381fe72b31415b6c0f25f2dcbd73caaa9ed67b16e6a502f8e576807105470f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6da9e5d264229eed97de1ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可恶。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e6a175df6c23bb59e055c29fae4828b796c899766d0194dab1d5d8317a3a008",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34c03ec9cb03ec6027d8402e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不懂啊ー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15ce617e0cd5498474461896f15f143e28894fed7da5caffc16814d491981fc3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1f38724fc1359b8e964d598",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好！走吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "94a65df2f9e8cedc8b2b3c79335a16547098897e908e544df9f9d284f4fef8b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c0a8b0f6d36e07f85ccff13",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来去吹吹海风吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e75b74a5e7baeb296088844f888c558531d030495c52fa2c1956f1252572fef1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ae32efd7c6929d3c5937e0dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，这都是你的功劳啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "49aba948ddaae56ed9fa66ed6d10bc72a3a8fc6518ae82613620579576366715",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c923954887b1ac89e8cf468",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要好好向你道谢呢！Thank You！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14d0de1ccfa0bbd9f9e084b9229a97453c87be85202e83e4ea86a0f6adb55b6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f529fa592d2e5a09946b88b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啊，那就来开始吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c186004bd9392c5a885a675b76708ecc3f3276a29f6aaae2bac9f640ee8ab023",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ecf236107af8d0aeaeaf4d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92ae3e5dcae9a53056d19b3106de1996e8c400c410dfd1c96cb651012cfebc4c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a34ff1c305393e9d8a5b46a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啊，打起精神去做吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ce4e9c414bac12c827d0c6817492bb1bae3dfd925a4b542637e7431c4d4ec4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b2088b918e8795015941905",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要好好向你道谢呢！Thank You！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14d0de1ccfa0bbd9f9e084b9229a97453c87be85202e83e4ea86a0f6adb55b6d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:687da28cfcb65b97cf11f2bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脚好轻盈啊……嘿嘿！\r\n你好好期待比赛的结果吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "361236ee6aeb9c40eb61137e168bed67dfcb1714fa2a724ad7530e94b1a0b7b0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
