      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1008",
        "400003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c082a8b744f892a9bca41bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天就别自主训练，去看机车吧！\r\n我本来是这么想……\r\n可是总觉得心情不怎么兴奋……",
