      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "机会难得，帮你选个圣诞节礼物吧。\r\n……只是顺便啦，\r\n我刚好也要买礼物……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b63183370e0d521a48969134df4a1ca15fdace148a17dc41abdbeb37db71c678",
